{
  "about": [
    "License texts for crates whose published crates.io archive holds no license file.",
    "Each text is the exact file from the upstream repository at the commit the crate version was published from,",
    "the git.sha1 its archive's .cargo_vcs_info.json records (\"published_from\"), stored in blobs/ under its git blob id.",
    "Where upstream publishes no full license text, the standard text of each license the crate names is taken from",
    "the SPDX License List (spdx/license-list-data, release v3.29.0), and \"note\" says so.",
    "scripts/desktop-sbom.py --notices puts these texts in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt, checks every blob id and every",
    "published_from commit against the crate in the cargo registry, and fails when a shipped component has no license text;",
    "scripts/desktop-upstream-licenses.py fetches every text again from upstream at its commit and compares it."
  ],
